    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nThis appealing three-bedroom bungalow offers spacious and adaptable accommodation in a peaceful rural setting, while remaining within convenient reach of Ballina town and a wide range of local amenities.\n\nThe property provides a comfortable and practical layout, ideally suited to family living, downsizers or those seeking a home with valuable additional space. A particular feature is the converted attic area, which can be adpated to suit the faily needs.\n\nThe home benefits from oil-fired central heating, together with a solid-fuel fire with back boiler, providing warmth and comfort throughout the year.\n\nExternally, the property is further enhanced by a detached garage and separate shed, offering excellent storage, workshop or hobby space. There is also ample off-street parking, making the property both practical and convenient for family living.\n\nThe mature gardens provide an attractive and private outdoor setting, with plenty of space for entertaining, outdoor dining and relaxation during the warmer months. These well-established surroundings add greatly to the overall appeal of the property and create a pleasant environment for both children and adults to enjoy.\n\nWhile offering all the benefits of rural living, the property is well positioned close to Ballina town, Ballina Golf Club, Bonniconlon village, local schools, shops and everyday services. This allows prospective purchasers to enjoy a quieter countryside lifestyle without sacrificing access to nearby amenities.\n\nOverall, this is an excellent opportunity to acquire a spacious and versatile three-bedroom bungalow with converted attic space, detached garage, shed, mature gardens and generous parking in an attractive rural location close to Ballina."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 1.91m x 4.07m\nWooden floors\n\nLiving Room - 4.19m x 4.66m\nOpen fire with back boiler,marble fireplace\n\nKitchen - 4.67m x 4.38m\n\n\nDining Room - 3.08m x 4.43m\nWood Floors with double doors out to patio area\n\nUtility Room - 2.30m x 1.37m\n\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.91m x 2.66m\nWalk in Wardrobe\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.28m x 4.16m\nWalk in Wardrobe\n\nEnsuite Bathroom - 1.24m x 2.26m\nFully tiled\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.91m x 3.09m\nBuilt in Wardrobes\n\nGarage - 10.09m x 4.95m\n\n\n"
